  {t="C", q=872, obj=2, name="The Disruption Ends", gv="Kill", gw="Razormane Defender", z=17, x=56.7, y=24.57, note="Kill Razormane Defender", tip="Back to the Razormane camp. Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them. Careful: Razormane Flesheaters and Berserkers (18-19) are elites in the camp's north-east, near Kreenig and the supply crates, and Chol'aruk (20, elite) lies in the cave under Thorn Hill beside them: pull Kreenig and the quilboar away from them one at a time, and leave the cave alone unless you are in a group.", section="The Barrens (14-23)", zoneName="The Barrens", p=582, place="The Disruption Ends", was=1740}, -- 1742
