  {t="N", text="Collect Fresh Zhevra Carcass", note="Fresh Zhevra Carcass, from any zhevra; Zhevra Chargers graze around the tree", tip="Ishamuhale, a big Sunscale raptor, only comes to a fresh kill: loot a Fresh Zhevra Carcass from a zhevra, then use it at the Dead Tree north-west of Ratchet, north of the road to the Crossroads, and be ready when he arrives.", section="The Barrens (14-23)", p=659, place="Ishamuhale"}, -- 1950
