  {t="FP", text="Freewind Post flight path", tip="Ride the lift down, then follow the road east through the canyons to Freewind Post, a Tauren village on top of the mesas. Its lift is on the north side.", section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (27-29)", p=858, place="Freewind Post"}, -- 2396
