  {t="G", text="Pesterhide Snarlers", z=400, x=42.4, y=40.4, tip="The next guide opens with Korran's The Swarm Grows at the Crossroads, offered from level 29. Short of 29? The Pesterhide Snarlers (28-29) prowl the canyon floor just north-west of Freewind Post: kill them until level 29. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=29.0, section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (27-29)", zoneName="Thousand Needles", p=878, place="Level 29"}, -- 2453
