  {t="F", text="The Sepulcher", tip="Fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher.", classes={"Shaman"}, section="Hillsbrad Foothills (29-31)", p=893, place="Brazier of Everfount"}, -- 2476
