  {t="C", q=98070, obj=2, name="Stop the Screeching", gv="Kill", gw="Screeching Roguefeather", foreverOnly=true, z=400, x=28.46, y=50.24, note="Kill Screeching Roguefeather", tip="West of Freewind Post, below Darkcloud Pinnacle, the harpies of Roguefeather Den (28-30). The Screeching Harpies, Roguefeathers and Windcallers there are Jandia's; her Stolen Freewind Supplies lie on the ground along the foot of the cliff and in the cave up on top. Grenka Bloodscreech (31) walks among them: thin out the harpies around her before you pull her, for Dorn's claw.", section="Thousand Needles & Desolace (30-33)", zoneName="Thousand Needles", p=948, place="The Screeching Canyon: kill these as you meet them", was=2585}, -- 2594
