  {t="G", text="Gadgetzan", z=440, x=51.6, y=26.0, tip="South from the raceway over the Tanaris border to Gadgetzan, the walled goblin town: learn its flight path and fly back to Freewind Post from there, which is quicker than the walk west across the flats, and the next guides fly straight to Gadgetzan.", section="Thousand Needles & Desolace (30-33)", zoneName="Tanaris", p=962, place="Gadgetzan"}, -- 2637
