  {t="G", text="Snapjaw Crocolisks", z=33, x=38.4, y=31.0, tip="Dustwallow's quests are 35-38. Still below 36 after Grom'gol's hand-ins? The Snapjaw Crocolisks (35-36) line the river just east of the camp, below the Mosh'Ogg hills: kill them until level 36, then walk back to the zeppelin tower. Leave the Mosh'Ogg ogres (36-37) above them alone.", lvlBelow=36.0, section="Stranglethorn Vale (33-36)", zoneName="Stranglethorn Vale", p=1018, place="Level 36"}, -- 2805
