  {t="N", text="Keep Mok'thardin's Enchantment, Zanzil's Secret and Kebok's tusks: the Skullsplitter chief, Zanzil's camps, the naga coast and Booty Bay come on your Stranglethorn stop at about 45, after the Riverglades.", section="Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (39-41)", p=1163, place="Grom'gol Base Camp"}, -- 3173
