  {t="FP", text="Stonard flight path", tip="No flight path to Stonard yet (the Riverglades skip the Swamp of Sorrows): ride north-east from Grom'gol through Duskwood and Deadwind Pass into the swamp, then east along the road to Stonard, and learn its flight path.", notTaxi="Stonard", section="Feralas, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows (46-48)", p=1374, place="To Stonard"}, -- 3703
