  {t="G", text="Firemane Scout", z=15, x=37.5, y=68.3, tip="Overlord Mok'Morokk's challenge, back in Brackenwall, needs a group of three. Alone, grind the Firemane scouts here on the Wyrmbog's northern edge to level 45.37 before you ride back north, so you don't come back down for it. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=45.37, solo=1173, section="Feralas, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows (46-48)", zoneName="Dustwallow Marsh", p=1396, place="Level 45.37"}, -- 3765
