  {t="N", text="Keep Tran'rek's Thistleshrub Valley: its Rootshapers (49-50) come with the Dunemaul Compound at the Broken Pillar, on the way into Un'Goro at about 51.", section="Tanaris & Searing Gorge (48-49)", p=1423, place="Gadgetzan"}, -- 3819
