  {t="C", q=3362, obj=1, name="Thistleshrub Valley", gv="Kill", gw="Gnarled Thistleshrub", z=440, x=29.65, y=66.4, note="Kill Gnarled Thistleshrub", tip="West from the compound, on the way to Un'Goro's ramp: Thistleshrub Valley's Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers (48-50) are Tran'rek's, carried from your first Tanaris visit. They wander a lot: pull them one at a time. Tran'rek takes them on the next guide's Gadgetzan stop, with Andi Lynn's.", section="Azshara, Feralas & Stranglethorn Vale (50-51)", zoneName="Tanaris", p=1542, place="Thistleshrub Valley", was=4112}, -- 4125
