  {t="G", text="Bridge into Blackrock Mountain", z=51, x=34.8, y=83.0, tip="Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals.", section="Un'Goro Crater, Burning Steppes & Western Plaguelands (51-53)", zoneName="Searing Gorge", p=1583, place="Into the Searing Gorge"}, -- 4228
