  {t="G", text="Scarlet forward camp", z=28, x=40.7, y=52.0, tip="From the Bulwark, follow the road east into the Western Plaguelands. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be.", section="Un'Goro Crater, Burning Steppes & Western Plaguelands (51-53)", zoneName="Western Plaguelands", p=1598, place="Scarlet forward camp"}, -- 4259
