  {t="G", text="Felpaw Village", z=361, x=61.5, y=10.5, tip="Winterspring's quests are 55-58. Below 55 after Winna's hand-ins? Felpaw Village's Deadwood furbolgs (53-55) are at your level and on your way north to Timbermaw Hold's tunnel: kill them until level 55. Every kill also raises your Timbermaw reputation. Careful: the Den Watchers and Avengers call nearby allies once below half health and run off for help when nearly dead: pull one at a time from the village's edge. This is a long top-up for a player who follows only this route. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Depths dungeon or the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=55.0, section="Felwood & Western Plaguelands (52-55)", zoneName="Felwood", p=1638, place="Level 55"}, -- 4362
