  {t="G", text="Rabid Shardtooth", z=618, x=60.1, y=71.2, tip="Top up here to level 59.9 before the hand-ins at Winterspring: they take you to level 60. The Rabid Shardtooths (59) of Frostwhisper Gorge, just north of the strange source, give far more experience than the furbolgs by Timbermaw Hold. Or, with a group, run the Scholomance dungeon or the Stratholme dungeon instead.", lvlBelow=59.9, section="Felwood, Moonglade & Winterspring (59-60)", zoneName="Winterspring", p=1908, place="Level 59.9"}, -- 4914
